{"seq":2,"slug":"auction-deposit-default","title":"拍卖保证金与买家违约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/auction-deposit-default","wordCount":1813,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"拍卖保证金与买家违约\">拍卖保证金与买家违约</h1><p>拍卖和固定价购物最大的差别是：赢家是「被选中」的，不是「主动下单」的。一个后悔的赢家可以直接不付款，卖家白等一场，其他竞买人也已经散去。保证金（deposit / 保证金 / 竞买保证金）就是用真金白银给「中标即承诺」这件事加一个价格。它同时带来一个工程难题：钱被冻结了，就必须有人负责在正确时点解冻——<strong>冻结容易、解冻难，遗漏的解冻就是永久占用的用户资金</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保证金在两个时点起作用：<strong>参与门槛</strong>（冻结一笔钱才有竞价资格）与<strong>违约赔偿</strong>（不履约则这笔钱被没收或部分没收）。这两个作用对应完全不同的数据模型：前者是账户上的一条冻结记录，后者是一笔资金划转。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>全额保证金</th>\n<th>定额保证金</th>\n<th>免保证金</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>冻结额</td>\n<td>按出价额比例</td>\n<td>固定金额</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛效果</td>\n<td>强（限制随意抬价）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高价值标的适配</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要风险</td>\n<td>冻结额过大劝退买家</td>\n<td>高价标的上限约束弱</td>\n<td>违约率高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[出价请求] --&gt; B{保证金充足?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝 需先冻结]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[出价进入有效集合]&#10;  D --&gt; E{拍卖结束}&#10;  E --&gt;|未中标| F[立即解冻]&#10;  E --&gt;|中标| G{按期付款?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[解冻 / 抵扣货款]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[违约判定]&#10;  I --&gt; J[按规则没收&lt;br/&gt;剩余部分退还]&#10;  J --&gt; K[计入违约档案]\">graph TD\n  A[出价请求] --&gt; B{保证金充足?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[拒绝 需先冻结]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[出价进入有效集合]\n  D --&gt; E{拍卖结束}\n  E --&gt;|未中标| F[立即解冻]\n  E --&gt;|中标| G{按期付款?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[解冻 / 抵扣货款]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[违约判定]\n  I --&gt; J[按规则没收&lt;br/&gt;剩余部分退还]\n  J --&gt; K[计入违约档案]</pre><h2 id=\"冻结与解冻的生命周期\">冻结与解冻的生命周期</h2><h3 id=\"冻结的记账方式\">冻结的记账方式</h3><p>不要把「冻结」实现为从余额里扣钱再存进一个虚拟户，那样对账会变成两套账。标准做法是在同一账户上维护 <code>available</code> 与 <code>frozen</code> 两个分量，冻结只是一次分量间的移动，<strong>总余额不变</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE account_balance (&#10;  account_id  BIGINT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  currency    CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  available   NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  frozen      NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  version     BIGINT  NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  CONSTRAINT non_negative CHECK (available &gt;= 0 AND frozen &gt;= 0)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE deposit_hold (&#10;  hold_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  auction_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  account_id  BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  amount      NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  status      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at  TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  released_at TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  reason      TEXT&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX deposit_one_active_per_auction&#10;  ON deposit_hold (auction_id, account_id) WHERE status = &#39;held&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> account_balance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  available   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  frozen      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> non_negative </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> frozen </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deposit_hold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hold_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  auction_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  account_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  released_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reason      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> deposit_one_active_per_auction</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deposit_hold (auction_id, account_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'held'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>deposit_one_active_per_auction</code> 是防重复冻结的第一道闸：同一账号在同一场拍卖上最多存在一条 <code>held</code> 记录，重试产生冲突即拒绝，避免「同一个出价冻结两次」。</p>\n<p>这种「占用可用余额但不转移资金」的语义与卡组织的授权冻结（authorization hold）完全一致：发卡方按批准金额冻结额度，买家的<strong>可用余额</strong>立刻下降，但<strong>账面余额</strong>未变，商户在清算前拿不到钱；冻结会在交易清算、被取消或过期时解除，过期未清算则额度自动释放（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Authorization_hold\">Wikipedia, Authorization hold</a>）。拍卖保证金比它多一条要求：不能依赖「过期自动释放」作为主路径，因为资金占用时间的上限是产品承诺而不是银行清算周期——所以必须显式穷举解冻触发点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解冻的触发点\">解冻的触发点</h3><p>解冻的触发点必须穷举，遗漏任何一个都会造成资金永久占用。这是本主题最容易出错的地方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>触发点</th>\n<th>解冻对象</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>被超越（不再是领先者）</td>\n<td>前者</td>\n<td>是否需要保持冻结取决于策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍卖结束未中标</td>\n<td>全部未中标者</td>\n<td>最常规路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中标且按期付款</td>\n<td>中标者</td>\n<td>抵扣货款或原路解冻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中标且违约</td>\n<td>中标者</td>\n<td>部分没收，剩余解冻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍卖被撤销 / 判为欺诈无效</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>含中标者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>流拍</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>见 <a href=\"unsold-relist-flow\">流拍处理与重新上拍</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证金到期（超长挂单）</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>兜底</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行的兜底扫描是必要的：无论前置逻辑多严密，都必须有一条「按时间兜底释放」的定时任务，用来兜住漏网记录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"解冻与幂等\">解冻与幂等</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH hold AS (&#10;  UPDATE deposit_hold&#10;     SET status = &#39;released&#39;, released_at = now(), reason = :reason&#10;   WHERE hold_id = :hold_id AND status = &#39;held&#39;&#10;  RETURNING account_id, amount&#10;)&#10;UPDATE account_balance b&#10;   SET available = b.available + h.amount,&#10;       frozen    = b.frozen    - h.amount,&#10;       version   = b.version + 1&#10;  FROM hold h&#10; WHERE b.account_id = h.account_id&#10;   AND b.frozen &gt;= h.amount;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> deposit_hold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'released'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, released_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), reason </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :reason</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hold_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :hold_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'held'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  RETURNING account_id, amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> account_balance b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">available</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       frozen    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hold h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">account_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">frozen</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一次动作完成状态迁移与余额移动，<code>status = &#39;held&#39;</code> 作为幂等守卫保证重复调用不会重复解冻。<code>b.frozen &gt;= h.amount</code> 是并发下的最后一道防线：若余额已被别的路径改动，更新会影响 0 行并回滚整个事务，从而暴露不一致而不是掩盖它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"违约判定与处置\">违约判定与处置</h2><h3 id=\"违约的定义要写成可判定的规则\">违约的定义要写成可判定的规则</h3><p>「买家违约」在业务上有很多模糊说法，在系统里必须是一条可判定的规则。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;default_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;payment_deadline_hours&quot;: 72,&#10;    &quot;reminder_schedule_hours&quot;: [24, 48, 66],&#10;    &quot;grace_after_deadline_hours&quot;: 24,&#10;    &quot;default_declared_when&quot;: &quot;deadline_passed &amp;&amp; no_payment &amp;&amp; no_seller_agreement&quot;,&#10;    &quot;penalty&quot;: { &quot;mode&quot;: &quot;forfeit_deposit&quot;, &quot;rate&quot;: 1.0, &quot;seller_share&quot;: 0.5 },&#10;    &quot;appeal_window_hours&quot;: 168,&#10;    &quot;record&quot;: { &quot;affects_buyer_rating&quot;: true, &quot;restricts_bidding&quot;: &quot;per_policy&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"default_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"payment_deadline_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"reminder_schedule_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">48</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">66</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"grace_after_deadline_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default_declared_when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deadline_passed &#x26;&#x26; no_payment &#x26;&#x26; no_seller_agreement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mode\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"forfeit_deposit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"seller_share\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"appeal_window_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">168</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"affects_buyer_rating\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"restricts_bidding\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>no_seller_agreement</code> 这一项很重要：买卖双方可以私下达成延期共识，违约判定必须能被卖家的豁免覆盖，否则会把「协商一致」误判成违约。</p>\n<h3 id=\"不可逆步骤的排序\">不可逆步骤的排序</h3><p>违约处置同样是一条 Saga，步骤顺序遵循 <a href=\"winning-close-settlement\">中标判定与成交结算</a> 里那条原则：不可逆的通报与档案写入排在最后。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;saga&quot;: &quot;buyer_default&quot;,&#10;  &quot;steps&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;declare_default&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;revoke_declaration&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;forfeit_deposit&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;refund_forfeited&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;credit_seller&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;debit_seller&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;relist_or_offer&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;withdraw_offer&quot; },&#10;    { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;notify_and_record&quot;, &quot;compensate&quot;: &quot;none&quot; }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"saga\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"buyer_default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"steps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"declare_default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"revoke_declaration\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"forfeit_deposit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"refund_forfeited\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"credit_seller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"debit_seller\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"relist_or_offer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"withdraw_offer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify_and_record\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"compensate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"none\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>notify_and_record</code> 不可补偿，所以它必须最后执行。实践中最常见的事故是「先扣了信用分、后因申诉成功撤销违约」——信用分已经公开无法收回。把档案写入放到流程末尾并绑定申诉窗口，能大幅降低这类不可逆伤害。</p>\n<h3 id=\"没收与分账\">没收与分账</h3><p>没收保证金后如何分配给卖家，涉及平台是否抽取分成。这属于资金核算问题，但有一个纯工程约束必须遵守：<strong>没收金额 = 卖家所得 + 平台所得</strong>，且三者必须在同一个事务内落账，不允许出现「扣了但没分」的中间态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>违约情形</th>\n<th>保证金处置</th>\n<th>卖家补偿</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未按期付款</td>\n<td>全额没收</td>\n<td>按政策比例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拍后反悔但卖家同意取消</td>\n<td>原路解冻</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中标者账号被判定欺诈</td>\n<td>冻结并进入调查</td>\n<td>按调查结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卖家原因导致无法履约</td>\n<td>全额解冻</td>\n<td>卖家承担</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一行是反向情形，容易被忽略：违约方不一定总是买家。卖家撤拍、货不对板都会导致交易失败，此时保证金必须原路退回，并可能触发对流拍处置的重新评估。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对账与用户体验\">对账与用户体验</h2><h3 id=\"资金对账\">资金对账</h3><p>日终必须验证恒等式：<code>Σ frozen 变动 = Σ 新增 hold − Σ 已释放 hold</code>，且 <code>Σ 没收额 = Σ 卖家所得 + Σ 平台所得</code>。两条恒等式任一不成立都说明有漏账。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用户侧可见性\">用户侧可见性</h3><p>冻结必须对用户可见且可解释：冻结了多少、为什么冻结、预计何时释放。缺少可见性会造成大量客服工单，也会让「兜底释放」变成一个用户不知情的事件。设计上应把 <code>deposit_hold</code> 的 <code>status</code> 与 <code>reason</code> 暴露给本人，并明确「拍卖结束后自动释放，无需操作」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"兜底释放的告警\">兜底释放的告警</h3><p>兜底释放是最后一道防线，它触发本身就说明前面的逻辑漏了触发点。因此每次兜底释放都应当记一条指标，按 <code>reason</code> 聚合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;metric&quot;: &quot;deposit_fallback_release_total&quot;,&#10;  &quot;labels&quot;: [&quot;reason&quot;, &quot;auction_status&quot;, &quot;hold_age_bucket&quot;],&#10;  &quot;alert&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;condition&quot;: &quot;rate(fallback_release_total[1h]) &gt; 0 for 3 consecutive hours&quot;,&#10;    &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;warning&quot;,&#10;    &quot;owner&quot;: &quot;auction-settlement&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;rationale&quot;: &quot;兜底释放持续触发说明前置触发点存在遗漏，需要补触发点而不是调大兜底阈值&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"metric\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"deposit_fallback_release_total\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"labels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"reason\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auction_status\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hold_age_bucket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"alert\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"condition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rate(fallback_release_total[1h]) > 0 for 3 consecutive hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"warning\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"owner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auction-settlement\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"rationale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"兜底释放持续触发说明前置触发点存在遗漏，需要补触发点而不是调大兜底阈值\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>告警的定位很关键：<strong>兜底释放的频率上升绝不应该通过延长兜底时限来「解决」</strong>，那只会让用户的资金被占用更久。正确响应是回到那七个触发点，找出为什么该触发却没触发。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保证金提供参与门槛与违约赔偿双重作用，二者的数据模型不同。</li>\n<li>冻结应在同一账户的 <code>available</code>/<code>frozen</code> 两分量间移动，总余额不变，避免两套账。</li>\n<li>部分唯一索引 <code>WHERE status=&#39;held&#39;</code> 是防重复冻结的第一道闸。</li>\n<li>解冻触发点必须穷举，并保留一条按时间兜底的释放任务。</li>\n<li>违约必须写成可判定的规则，且能被卖家豁免覆盖。</li>\n<li>违约 Saga 中不可逆的通报与档案写入排在最后，并与申诉窗口绑定。</li>\n<li>资金恒等式（冻结变动、没收分账）是日终对账的硬性检查项。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"拍卖保证金与买家违约","id":"拍卖保证金与买家违约"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"冻结与解冻的生命周期","id":"冻结与解冻的生命周期"},{"level":3,"text":"冻结的记账方式","id":"冻结的记账方式"},{"level":3,"text":"解冻的触发点","id":"解冻的触发点"},{"level":3,"text":"解冻与幂等","id":"解冻与幂等"},{"level":2,"text":"违约判定与处置","id":"违约判定与处置"},{"level":3,"text":"违约的定义要写成可判定的规则","id":"违约的定义要写成可判定的规则"},{"level":3,"text":"不可逆步骤的排序","id":"不可逆步骤的排序"},{"level":3,"text":"没收与分账","id":"没收与分账"},{"level":2,"text":"对账与用户体验","id":"对账与用户体验"},{"level":3,"text":"资金对账","id":"资金对账"},{"level":3,"text":"用户侧可见性","id":"用户侧可见性"},{"level":3,"text":"兜底释放的告警","id":"兜底释放的告警"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中标判定与成交结算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/winning-close-settlement"},"next":{"title":"流拍处理与重新上拍","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/online-auction-marketplace/auction-close-settle/unsold-relist-flow"}}